Added `sles-15.7-*` (SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP7) and `sles-16.0-*` configs for x86_64, aarch64, ppc64le and s390x. They need a SUSE subscription, and a distribution-gpg-keys version with the SHA-256 re-signed SUSE keys. The bootstrap chroot gets dnf (SLES 15) or dnf5 (SLES 16) from SUSE Package Hub; the buildroot only uses the SLES repositories.
